<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine soybeans seen benefitting from rain.</title>
<headline>Argentine soybeans seen benefitting from rain.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's soybean crop should benefit from rain forecast for crop areas Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>The rain should also help the developing maize crop, they said.</p>
<p>The government's Meteorological Service forecast possible storms and showers throughout the grain belt. Weather Services Corp said highs in crop areas would range from 80-90 F (27-32 C).</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
